        "original_id": "999a9375-9501-54c4-bde8-c19a6c66a9ba",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Campbell\n- Places: North Carolina, eastern Tennessee, Southwest Territory, Tennessee\n- Organizations: North Carolina state assembly, North Carolina Superior Court\n- Political Entities: State of Franklin\n- Roles: politician, judge, leader\n\nFacts:\n- The State of Franklin, also called the Free Republic of Franklin or the State of Frankland, was an unrecognized autonomous territory in what is now eastern Tennessee, United States.\n- David Campbell lived from 1750 to 1812.\n- David Campbell was a prominent politician and judge.\n- David Campbell was a member of the North Carolina state assembly.\n- David Campbell was a leader in the State of Franklin.\n- David Campbell served as a judge in the North Carolina Superior Court, the Southwest Territory, and the state of Tennessee.",
